1co/Sony-PMCA-RE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/715/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/715/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/715/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/715","id":4591405195,"node_id":"I_kwDOAh3ZFM8AAAABEatIiw","number":715,"title":"ILME-FX3A support - serviceshell authentication timeout","user":{"login":"Kuetuj","id":290829516,"node_id":"U_kgDOEVW0zA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290829516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj","html_url":"https://github.com/Kuetuj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kuetuj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2026-06-04T18:59:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T20:38:16Z","closed_at":"2026-06-09T18:09:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Camera model:** ILME-FX3A\n**OS:** macOS 26.2 (Apple M2 Max)\n**Python:** 3.9.6\n**Branch:** master (with PR #714 PAL/NTSC tweak applied)\n\n## Summary\n\nAttempting to use `serviceshell` and `updatershell` commands with an ILME-FX3A. The camera is detected correctly in mass storage mode, but the connection fails at the authentication step.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n```\npython pmca-console.py serviceshell\n```\n\n## Output\n\n```\nUsing drivers libusb-MSC, libusb-MTP, libusb-vendor-specific\nLooking for Sony devices\n\nQuerying mass storage device\nSony DSC is a camera in mass storage mode\n\nSwitching to service mode\nusb.core.USBTimeoutError: [Errno 60] Operation timed out\n[...]\npmca.usb.driver.generic.GenericUsbException\n```\n\nFor `updatershell`, the error is:\n```\nError: Model \"ILME-FX3A\" does not support custom firmware updates. Please check the compatibility list.\n```\n\n## Goal\n\nI'm trying to apply the PAL/NTSC tweak from PR #714 on my ILME-FX3A, which is locked in NTSC mode after a firmware update.\n\nIs there any plan to support the FX3A? Are there specific firmware files or protocol changes needed for this camera generation? Any guidance would be appreciated.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/715/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/715/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/327","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/327/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/327/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/327/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE/issues/327","id":1331481380,"node_id":"I_kwDOAh3ZFM5PXMsk","number":327,"title":"v0.18 GUI not working on my Mac","user":{"login":"alpha1717","id":105681196,"node_id":"U_kgD